      "question": "Which of the following gases get released when dilute sulphuric acid (H2SO4 ) reacts with magnesium (Mg)? &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2327;&#2376;&#2360; &#2340;&#2348; &#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2348; &#2340;&#2344;&#2369; &#2360;&#2354;&#2381;&#2347;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2309;&#2350;&#2381;&#2354; (H2SO4) &#2350;&#2376;&#2327;&#2381;&#2344;&#2368;&#2358;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350; (Mg) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Which of the following gases get released when dilute sulphuric acid (H2SO4 ) reacts with magnesium (Mg)?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2380;&#2344; &#2360;&#2368; &#2327;&#2376;&#2360; &#2340;&#2348; &#2344;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376; &#2332;&#2348; &#2340;&#2344;&#2369; &#2360;&#2354;&#2381;&#2347;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2309;&#2350;&#2381;&#2354; (H2SO4) &#2350;&#2376;&#2327;&#2381;&#2344;&#2368;&#2358;&#2367;&#2351;&#2350; (Mg) &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2366;&#2341; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;?</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "SO3 &#2319;&#2360;&#2323;3",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">SO3</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2360;&#2323;3</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "SO2 &#2319;&#2360;&#2323;2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">SO2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2360;&#2323;2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "O2 &#2323;2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">O2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2323;2</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "H2 &#2319;&#2330; 2",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">H2</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2319;&#2330; 2</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>When magnesium reacts with dilute sulfuric acid, it produces magnesium sulfate and hydrogen gas:</p><p>Mg + H2SO4 &rarr; MgSO4 + H2</p>",
