      "question": "Burning of coal is an example of______. &#2325;&#2379;&#2351;&#2354;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2332;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; ______ &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Burning of coal is an example of______.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2325;&#2379;&#2351;&#2354;&#2375; &#2325;&#2366; &#2332;&#2354;&#2344;&#2366; ______ &#2325;&#2366; &#2319;&#2325; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p></span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "decomposition reaction &#2309;&#2346;&#2328;&#2335;&#2344; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">decomposition reaction</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2309;&#2346;&#2328;&#2335;&#2344; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;</span>"
