          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">double displacement reaction</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2367;&#2357;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2344; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "combination reaction &#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">combination reaction</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2360;&#2306;&#2351;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "displacement reaction &#2357;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2344; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">displacement reaction</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2357;&#2367;&#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2346;&#2344; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>The process of burning coal involves a <b>combination reaction</b>. A combination reaction occurs when two or more elements or compounds combine together to form a single compound.</p>",
