      "question": "The cause of a redox reaction is the: &#2352;&#2375;&#2337;&#2377;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;:",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The cause of a redox reaction is the:</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2352;&#2375;&#2337;&#2377;&#2325;&#2381;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2339; &#2361;&#2376;:</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "Transfer of electrons between two reactants. &#2342;&#2379; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2311;&#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2377;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2339;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Transfer of electrons between two reactants.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2379; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2311;&#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2377;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2339;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Transfer of electrons between two products. &#2342;&#2379; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2346;&#2366;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2311;&#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2377;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2339;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Transfer of electrons between two products.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2379; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2346;&#2366;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2311;&#2354;&#2375;&#2325;&#2381;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2377;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2339;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Transfer of neutrons between two reactants. &#2342;&#2379; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2377;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2339;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Transfer of neutrons between two reactants.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2379; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2344;&#2381;&#2351;&#2370;&#2335;&#2381;&#2352;&#2377;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2360;&#2381;&#2341;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366;&#2306;&#2340;&#2352;&#2339;&#2404;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Exchange of halogens between two reactants. &#2342;&#2379; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2361;&#2376;&#2354;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2342;&#2366;&#2344;-&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2342;&#2366;&#2344;&#2404;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Exchange of halogens between two reactants.</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2379; &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2348;&#2368;&#2330; &#2361;&#2376;&#2354;&#2379;&#2332;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2310;&#2342;&#2366;&#2344;-&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2342;&#2366;&#2344;&#2404;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "A",
      "solution": "<p>A redox reaction involves the transfer of electrons, where one reactant is oxidized (loses electrons) and the other is reduced (gains electrons).</p>",
