    {
      "id": "cb6f94d2a511-q5",
      "number": 5,
      "question": "The type of reaction where a material required for the reaction to proceed (such as a catalyst) is saturated by the reactants is called a ________ order reaction. &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2361; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2310;&#2357;&#2358;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325; &#2346;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; (&#2332;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2352;&#2325;) &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2360;&#2306;&#2340;&#2371;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, ________ &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2361;&#2354;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;",
      "questionHtml": "<span class=\"eqt\"><p>The type of reaction where a material required for the reaction to proceed (such as a catalyst) is saturated by the reactants is called a ________ order reaction.</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2366; &#2357;&#2361; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319; &#2310;&#2357;&#2358;&#2381;&#2351;&#2325; &#2346;&#2342;&#2366;&#2352;&#2381;&#2341; (&#2332;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2340;&#2381;&#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2375;&#2352;&#2325;) &#2309;&#2349;&#2367;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2360;&#2306;&#2340;&#2371;&#2346;&#2381;&#2340; &#2361;&#2379; &#2332;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;, ________ &#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2350; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2340;&#2367;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2325;&#2361;&#2354;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</span>",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "First &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">First</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "Second &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Second</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "Zero &#2358;&#2370;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Zero</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2358;&#2370;&#2344;&#2381;&#2351;</span>"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "Third &#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366;",
          "html": "<span class=\"eqt\">Third</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">&#2340;&#2368;&#2360;&#2352;&#2366;</span>"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "C",
      "solution": "<p>A zero-order reaction occurs when the rate of reaction is independent of reactant concentration because the catalyst or active sites are saturated. An example is enzyme-catalyzed reactions at high substrate concentration.</p>",
